{
  "_comment": "The control plane's standard components (ADR-035): every manager and controller tappaas-cicd ships, and the two services built beside them. One list: scripts/control-plane-registry.sh writes it into config/control-plane.json, the registry the self-check and the console read, and scripts/test/test-control-plane-registry.sh keeps it equal to the directories and to flake.nix's packages. A manager with manifest 'help-json' answers --help --json and appears in the console. kind: manager | controller | service. package: the flake package that builds it; null for bash, which needs no build. aliases: old names a component also answers to, linked beside it for one release (ADR-035 P2). plugsInto: the managers a controller plugs into (ADR-035 D3, D5).",
